 bow? Dash or dodge? Combat is **fast,intense, and tactical**. Bosses evolve. Only **teamwork** and **smart planning** will keep you alive.\n\n\ud83c\udf84**Shape Your Playstyle**: Unlock your **talent tree** and **shape your playstyle**: smash or snipe. It's up to you. \n\n\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f**Choose Your Hero Class**: Witch Hunter, Black Knight, Birdman...**More coming soon**\u2014\u2014and you help vote on the next avatar in the Discord.\n\n\ud83e\udde0**Explore and Discover**: Discover hidden rooms. Trigger traps. Loot hard. This dungeon **goes deeper than it looks**...\n\n", "short_description": "Enter a Spooky 4-floor Dungeon\u2014\u2014packed with monsters, traps, secrets and surprises. Fight, explore, or just fool around with friends."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dungeonblock.com/privacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Joy Inventor", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://dungeonblock.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "24606307042303653"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1020881323499500"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1020881323499500"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 17491801